<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44187" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sīgēum</span></b> , i,
			n., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σίγειον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a promontory in
			Troas</i>, <i>and a town of the same name</i>, <i>where Achilles was buried</i>, now <i>Yenishehr</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 1, 18, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 30,
				33, § 124</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Arch.
				10, 24</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Fam. 5, 12, 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 44,
				28, 6</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sīgēus</span></b>  (collat. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sīgēïa</span></b> 
			tellus, <i><span class="en">Ov. H. 1, 33</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sigeïa litora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. M.
					13, 3</span></i>
			), a, um, adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Sigeum</i>, <i>Sigean</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">litora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mel.
					2, 7, 4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 12, 71</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">freta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 2, 312</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">campi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 7, 294</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">profundum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 11, 197</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<b>Poet.</b> transf., <i>Trojan</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">natum Sigeo in pulvere,</span>”
				i.e. <i>in the Trojan war</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Stat. Achill. 1, 84</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>Roman</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">colonus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					9, 203</span></i>
			.</div>
